diff --git a/spike-dx/boring/.pi/extensions/codebase-qa/skills/codebase-qa/SKILL.md b/spike-dx/boring/.pi/extensions/codebase-qa/skills/codebase-qa/SKILL.md
new file mode 100644
index 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000..3f0ddc614323282ce3948bd33dbaa06ccc577c9a
--- /dev/null
+++ b/spike-dx/boring/.pi/extensions/codebase-qa/skills/codebase-qa/SKILL.md
@@ -0,0 +1,11 @@
+---
+name: codebase-qa
+description: Investigate architecture, behavior, and file-location questions using evidence from the current codebase.
+---
+
+Before answering a codebase question:
+
+1. Call `codebase_context` for the workspace root and evidence standard.
+2. Inspect the relevant files with read, grep, and find.
+3. Separate observed facts from inferences.
+4. Cite the file paths supporting the answer.
